WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.750
The initial heavy kick is blocked against cornered Ryu.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.350
The normal throw connects under held heavy-Level-2 rain.

3
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:09.500
Held light Sun Flare stores two Crests before the dash and OD pickup.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.750
Two performed heavy Sun Shots juggle Ryu in the corner.

5
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:12.900
Light Sun Rise ends the corner route.
